    "detailed_description": "Bizarre, tough little platformer. Help Get Baz Home after a night out and a dodgy kebab, be careful though - the path is far from straightforward. A series of warped, twisted, and disjointed levels stand between Baz and his gaff.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a new twist on the retro platformer format, each level is rendered with its own unique effect - distorting the level in unusual ways, offering a unique challenge to players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete 4 worlds each with 7  challenging levels and bosses. Dodge fireballs and jump off walls to reach the exit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is easily moddable -  each level consists of an image for the layout and a shader which handles the distortion effect.",
